{{col-top|2|cog}}
Cognate with {{cog|yol|bothom}}, {{m|yol|bottom|t=bottom}}, {{cog|stq|Boudem|t=floor; ground}}, {{cog|fy|boaiem|t=floor; ground}}, {{cog|nl|bodem}}, {{m|nl|boom}}, {{m|nl|boôm|t=bottom; ground, soil}}, {{cog|de|Boden|t=floor; ground; soil}}, {{cog|li|baom|t=bottom; ground, soil}}, {{cog|lb|Buedem|t=bottom; earth, soil}}, {{cog|wym|bödum|t=bottom; ground}}, {{cog|da|bund|t=bottom}}, {{cog|ovd|buottn|t=bottom}}, {{cog|fo|botnur|t=bottom}}, {{cog|is,nn|botn|t=bottom}}, {{cog|nb|botn}}, {{m|nb|bunn|t=bottom}}, {{cog|sv|botten|t=bottom}}; also {{cog|ga,gd|bonn|t=base, bottom; sole (of foot)}}, {{cog|la|fundus|t=bottom}} (whence {{doublet|notext=1|en|fund}}, via {{cog|fr|-}}), {{cog|grc|πυθμήν|t=bottom of a cup or jar; the bottom of the sea; butt of a tree}}, {{cog|sq|buzë|t=rocky chasm}}, {{cog|hy|անդունդ}}, {{m|hy|անդունդք|t=abyss, chasm}}, {{cog|kmr|bin|t=bottom}}, {{cog|fa|بن|tr=bon|t=bottom}}, {{cog|sa|बुध्न|t=bottom}}.
